{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2022-06-07 16:42:00', 'title': "MOODY'S UPGRADES PPL CREDIT RATING FOLLOWING COMPANY'S STRATEGIC REPOSITIONING AND ACQUISITION OF THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY", 'text': "MOODY'S CITES IMPROVED OVERALL BUSINESS RISK PROFILE OF PPL'S U.S.-FOCUSED REGULATED PORTFOLIO ALLENTOWN, PA. , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE ON MONDAY UPGRADED THE INVESTMENT-GRADE CREDIT RATINGS OF PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) AND PPL CAPITAL FUNDING, INC., FOLLOWING PPL'S RECENT ACQUISITION OF THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY, WHICH IS NOW DOING BUSINESS AS RHODE ISLAND ENERGY."}